<title>SPAIN: Jordan king regrets deaths, vows to work for peace.</title>
<headline>Jordan king regrets deaths, vows to work for peace.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's King Hussein said he deeply regretted the killing of innocent Israeli children and vowed on Thursday to work for the rest of his life for Middle East peace.</p>
<p>&quot;I shall do everything I can as long as I live to leave behind a legacy of peace,&quot; he told journalists while in Spain on a private visit. A Jordanian soldier shot dead seven Israeli schoolgirls on the border between Israel and Jordan earlier on Thursday.</p>
</text>
